  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 2.04,
      "end": 4.96,
      "en": "Hello English learners, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "您好英语学习者，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.32,
      "end": 5.84,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.12,
      "end": 6.86,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 7.82,
      "end": 12.84,
      "en": "And today we have another romantic lesson, kind of romantic.",
      "zh": "而今天我们还有另一个浪漫的教训，有点浪漫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 13.34,
      "end": 14.26,
      "en": "A little romantic.",
      "zh": "有点浪漫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 15.2,
      "end": 19.28,
      "en": "We got a boyfriend and a girlfriend and they're apologizing to each other.",
      "zh": "我们有一个男朋友和一个女朋友，他们互相道歉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 19.74,
      "end": 23.9,
      "en": "Okay, so it's a very common situation and we're going to be talking about love.",
      "zh": "好的，所以这是一个非常常见的情况，我们将谈论爱情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 24.3,
      "end": 28.56,
      "en": "We're also going to talk about different pet names that are commonly used in English.",
      "zh": "我们还将讨论英语中常用的不同宠物名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 28.88,
      "end": 31.9,
      "en": "That are used with your boyfriend or girlfriend.",
      "zh": "与您的男朋友或女朋友一起使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 32.36,
      "end": 33.28,
      "en": "Okay, very good.",
      "zh": "好，很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 33.94,
      "end": 39.18,
      "en": "So let's listen to this dialogue for the first time and see what's happening with our couple.",
      "zh": "所以让我们第一次听这个对话，看看我们的夫妻发生了什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 57.0,
      "end": 61.62,
      "en": "Can we talk?",
      "zh": "我们能谈谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 61.62,
      "end": 62.34,
      "en": "You know what I mean.",
      "zh": "你懂我的意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 64.9,
      "end": 67.45,
      "en": "I want to know where this relationship is going.",
      "zh": "我想知道我们这段关系会走向哪里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 68.3,
      "end": 71.69,
      "en": "I'm in love with you and I need to know.",
      "zh": "我爱上了你，我需要知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 73.76,
      "end": 74.37,
      "en": "I'm awesome.",
      "zh": "我很棒啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 75.27,
      "end": 77.45,
      "en": "Well I guess that's my answer, isn't it?",
      "zh": "好吧，我想这就是你的回答了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 78.86,
      "end": 82.98,
      "en": "Look, if you don't love me, it's not a thing, alright?",
      "zh": "要是你不爱我，就直说，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 82.98,
      "end": 84.86,
      "en": "We've had our laughs, but I don't appreciate...",
      "zh": "我们在一起也开心过，可我不想……"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 85.94,
      "end": 86.9,
      "en": "Maybe it's just time we...",
      "zh": "也许我们该……"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 87.3,
      "end": 88.74,
      "en": "Baby, I love you so much.",
      "zh": "宝贝，我非常爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 89.14,
      "end": 89.32,
      "en": "You do?",
      "zh": "是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 90.14,
      "end": 91.78,
      "en": "I love you and I think you're awesome.",
      "zh": "我爱你，我觉得你很棒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 92.26,
      "end": 93.66,
      "en": "Oh, I love you too.",
      "zh": "哦，我也爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 94.28,
      "end": 95.86,
      "en": "Come on, put the gun down.",
      "zh": "拜托，把枪放下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 96.3,
      "end": 98.52,
      "en": "Oh baby, I'm so sorry.",
      "zh": "哦，宝贝，我很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 103.11,
      "end": 105.25,
      "en": "Okay, so romantic and dramatic.",
      "zh": "好吧，如此浪漫和戏剧化。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 105.46,
      "end": 109.1,
      "en": "Yeah, I think she really needed to hear that shh.",
      "zh": "是的，我想她真的需要听到那个嘘。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 109.1,
      "end": 111.89,
      "en": "Right, so I think she really wanted to hear I love you.",
      "zh": "对，所以我想她真的很想听我爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 112.3,
      "end": 113.13,
      "en": "Yeah, that's right.",
      "zh": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 113.7,
      "end": 121.22,
      "en": "And there's some interesting phrases here in this dialogue and today we're going to focus mostly on phrases.",
      "zh": "在这个对话中有一些有趣的短语，今天我们将主要关注短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 121.22,
      "end": 123.91,
      "en": "So why don't we start with Fluency Builder.",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不从 Fluency Builder 开始。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 125.22,
      "end": 126.08,
      "en": "Fluency Builder.",
      "zh": "流利表达。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 127.01,
      "end": 134.81,
      "en": "Okay, on Fluency Builder today, we're going to take a look at some of these phrases and the first one is very important and very different.",
      "zh": "好的，今天在 Flueny Builder 上，我们将看看其中一些短语，第一个非常重要且非常不同。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 135.17,
      "end": 144.75,
      "en": "So obviously this dialogue is about love and we heard two different ways that this word is used and the first one is to love someone.",
      "zh": "很明显，这个对话是关于爱的，我们听到了两种不同的使用方式，第一个是爱一个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 145.11,
      "end": 147.19,
      "en": "Right, so he said, I love you.",
      "zh": "对，他说，我爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 147.37,
      "end": 148.23,
      "en": "Yeah, I love you.",
      "zh": "是的，我爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 148.7,
      "end": 150.7,
      "en": "We all pretty much understand what that means.",
      "zh": "我们几乎都明白这意味着什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 150.9,
      "end": 155.66,
      "en": "Right, but they also mentioned to be in love with someone.",
      "zh": "是的，但他们也提到爱上了一个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 155.96,
      "end": 159.06,
      "en": "Okay, so he said, I am in love with you.",
      "zh": "好吧，他说，我爱上了你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 159.28,
      "end": 160.66,
      "en": "I'm in love with you.",
      "zh": "我爱上了你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 161.08,
      "end": 161.62,
      "en": "In love.",
      "zh": "恋爱中。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 162.12,
      "end": 165.76,
      "en": "Okay, so what's the difference between to love and to be in love?",
      "zh": "好吧，那么爱和恋爱有什么区别呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 166.16,
      "end": 172.4,
      "en": "To be in love with someone means that you have these strong romantic feelings towards somebody.",
      "zh": "爱上一个人意味着你对某人有着强烈的浪漫感情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 172.73,
      "end": 173.09,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 173.43,
      "end": 179.99,
      "en": "So you can only be in love with your boyfriend, your girlfriend, your husband or your wife.",
      "zh": "所以你只能爱上你的男朋友、你的女朋友、你的丈夫或你的妻子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 180.57,
      "end": 185.11,
      "en": "So you can love your parents, you can love your family, but you can't be in love with them.",
      "zh": "所以你可以爱你的父母，你可以爱你的家人，但你不能爱上他们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 186.1,
      "end": 188.82,
      "en": "You can only be in love with your girlfriend, boyfriend, husband, wife.",
      "zh": "你只能爱上你的女朋友、男朋友、丈夫、妻子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 188.82,
      "end": 188.95,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 189.82,
      "end": 190.82,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 190.82,
      "end": 192.66,
      "en": "So moving on to the next phrase.",
      "zh": "所以继续下一个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 193.14,
      "end": 197.82,
      "en": "Now the girl asked her boyfriend, can we talk?",
      "zh": "现在女孩问她男朋友，我们可以谈谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 197.82,
      "end": 198.3,
      "en": "Can we talk?",
      "zh": "我们能谈谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 198.82,
      "end": 199.28,
      "en": "Can we talk?",
      "zh": "我们能谈谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 199.94,
      "end": 201.26,
      "en": "This is a very simple sentence.",
      "zh": "这是一个非常简单的句子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 201.52,
      "end": 202.8,
      "en": "Right, we know the meaning, right?",
      "zh": "对，我们知道意思，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 203.42,
      "end": 205.18,
      "en": "But why does she say, can we talk?",
      "zh": "但她为什么说，我们可以谈谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 205.88,
      "end": 211.0,
      "en": "Okay, so you use this when you want to start a conversation about something serious.",
      "zh": "好的，所以当你想开始谈论严肃的事情时，你会使用它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 211.52,
      "end": 216.3,
      "en": "Okay, so if you wanted to talk to me about my new shirt.",
      "zh": "好的，所以如果你想和我谈谈我的新衬衫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 216.95,
      "end": 220.05,
      "en": "I wouldn't ask, I wouldn't say, hey Marco, can we talk?",
      "zh": "我不会问，我不会说，嘿，马可，我们可以谈谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 220.85,
      "end": 222.05,
      "en": "Oh, I really like your shirt.",
      "zh": "哦，我真的很喜欢你的衬衫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 222.27,
      "end": 222.81,
      "en": "Where'd you get it?",
      "zh": "你从哪里得到的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 222.99,
      "end": 223.77,
      "en": "Exactly, right?",
      "zh": "没错，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 224.21,
      "end": 225.19,
      "en": "It has to be serious.",
      "zh": "它必须是认真的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 225.19,
      "end": 226.03,
      "en": "It has to be serious.",
      "zh": "它必须是认真的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 226.57,
      "end": 229.67,
      "en": "So usually if somebody says, hey, can we talk?",
      "zh": "所以通常如果有人说，嘿，我们可以谈谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 230.23,
      "end": 232.27,
      "en": "It means that there's going to be a serious topic.",
      "zh": "这意味着会有一个严肃的话题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 232.39,
      "end": 233.69,
      "en": "It's going to be probably bad news.",
      "zh": "这可能是个坏消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 234.26,
      "end": 235.98,
      "en": "Maybe bad news.",
      "zh": "也许是坏消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 235.98,
      "end": 236.85,
      "en": "So can we talk?",
      "zh": "那我们可以谈谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 237.16,
      "end": 240.27,
      "en": "So if your boyfriend or girlfriend tells you this, well, it's not a good sign.",
      "zh": "所以如果你的男朋友或女朋友告诉你，好吧，这不是一个好兆头。"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 240.55,
      "end": 240.85,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 241.39,
      "end": 241.67,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 241.83,
      "end": 246.07,
      "en": "And the last phrase that we have on Fluency Builder, you know what I mean.",
      "zh": "我们在 Fluency Builder 上的最后一句话，你知道我的意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 246.44,
      "end": 247.34,
      "en": "You know what I mean.",
      "zh": "你懂我的意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 247.84,
      "end": 248.84,
      "en": "You know what I mean.",
      "zh": "你懂我的意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 249.22,
      "end": 250.06,
      "en": "You know what I mean.",
      "zh": "你懂我的意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "start": 250.52,
      "end": 250.84,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "start": 251.5,
      "end": 254.12,
      "en": "So again, this phrase is very simple to understand, right?",
      "zh": "再说一次，这句话很容易理解，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "start": 254.58,
      "end": 255.58,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "start": 255.58,
      "end": 257.46,
      "en": "So you know what I'm talking about.",
      "zh": "所以你知道我在说什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 258.1,
      "end": 260.3,
      "en": "You understand me.",
      "zh": "你明白我的意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "start": 260.3,
      "end": 263.92,
      "en": "But the interesting thing is that we can also make it a question.",
      "zh": "但有趣的是，我们也可以让它成为一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 264.78,
      "end": 267.98,
      "en": "And it's all about the change in tone.",
      "zh": "这一切都与基调的变化有关。"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 268.22,
      "end": 280.64,
      "en": "Okay, so with this in mind, let's listen to two examples of the same phrase but with different tones and you try to see which one is the question.",
      "zh": "好吧，考虑到这一点，让我们听两个相同短语但音调不同的例子，你试着看看哪一个是问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 280.64,
      "end": 284.18,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 284.18,
      "end": 286.18,
      "en": "I'm tired of doing nothing all day here at home.",
      "zh": "我厌倦了在家里整天无所事事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 286.5,
      "end": 286.98,
      "en": "You know what I mean?",
      "zh": "你懂我的意思吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 290.48,
      "end": 293.1,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
