      "end": 296.32,
      "en": "You know what I mean when I say that I don't like your friends.",
      "zh": "当我说我不喜欢你的朋友时，你知道我的意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "start": 299.1,
      "end": 301.62,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
