      "en": "I hate this class.",
      "zh": "我讨厌这门课。"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 302.82,
      "end": 303.72,
      "en": "It's so boring and tedious.",
      "zh": "它是如此无聊和乏味。"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 304.5,
      "end": 305.06,
      "en": "You know what I mean?",
      "zh": "你懂我的意思吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "start": 307.78,
      "end": 307.94,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "start": 308.78,
      "end": 311.5,
      "en": "So we heard the examples and well, maybe you guessed it right.",
      "zh": "所以我们听到了例子，好吧，也许你猜对了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 312.14,
      "end": 314.28,
      "en": "The second example was the question.",
      "zh": "第二个例子是问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "start": 314.52,
      "end": 314.78,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 315.08,
      "end": 315.56,
      "en": "You know what I mean?",
      "zh": "你懂我的意思吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "start": 315.96,
      "end": 316.14,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 317.62,
      "end": 322.1,
      "en": "So basically, you're asking the person if they understand your idea or they understand what you're talking about.",
      "zh": "所以基本上，你在问他们是否理解你的想法，或者他们理解你在说什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 322.1,
      "end": 325.36,
      "en": "So maybe you can say, the professor wasn't very clear on his instructions.",
      "zh": "所以也许你可以说，教授对他的指示不是很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 325.8,
      "end": 327.32,
      "en": "So how was I supposed to do the homework?",
      "zh": "那么我应该怎么做作业呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 327.64,
      "end": 328.08,
      "en": "You know what I mean?",
      "zh": "你懂我的意思吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 328.44,
      "end": 331.38,
      "en": "So you're asking me to confirm that I understand you.",
      "zh": "所以你要求我确认我理解你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
