      "en": "And then we'll come back and give you some examples of pet names in English.",
      "zh": "然后我们会回来给你一些英语宠物名字的例子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 615.54,
      "end": 620.18,
      "en": "Can we talk?",
