      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 737.14,
      "end": 738.31,
      "en": "So, I want to hear from our listeners.",
      "zh": "所以，我想听听我们的听众的意见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 738.7,
      "end": 741.0,
      "en": "Are there any common pet names in your language?",
      "zh": "您的语言中有常见的宠物名称吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 741.66,
      "end": 750.68,
      "en": "I know that in Spanish, we can sometimes call our girlfriend gorda, which actually means fat.",
      "zh": "我知道在西班牙语中，我们有时可以称我们的女朋友为 Gorda，这实际上是指胖子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 751.14,
      "end": 752.14,
      "en": "But it's not in a bad way.",
      "zh": "但这并不是一个糟糕的方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 752.4,
      "end": 752.54,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 753.14,
      "end": 755.14,
      "en": "It's a sweet way of calling your girlfriend.",
      "zh": "这是给女朋友打电话的甜蜜方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 755.94,
      "end": 759.68,
      "en": "And I know in French, you can say ma pouce, which basically means my flea.",
      "zh": "我知道在法语中，你可以说ma pouce，这基本上意味着我的跳蚤。"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 760.14,
      "end": 761.14,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
