      "end": 761.58,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 761.66,
      "end": 764.6,
      "en": "So, some of them, if you translate, you wouldn't really use in English.",
      "zh": "所以，其中一些，如果你翻译，你不会真正用英语。"
    },
